4:800   test.tscn::GDScript_37kl0:35 @ render(): Condition \"data.is_empty()\" is true. Returning: Ref<Image>()\n  <C++ Source>  servers\\rendering\\renderer_rd\\storage_rd\\texture_storage.cpp:1832 @ RendererRD::TextureStorage::texture_2d_get()\n  <Stack Trace> test.tscn::GDScript_37kl0:35 @ render()\n\nE 0:00:04:800   test.tscn::GDScript_37kl0:36 @ render(): Invalid image: null\n  <C++ Error>   Condition \"p_image.is_null()\" is true. Returning: Ref<ImageTexture>()\n  <C++ Source>  scene\\resources\\image_texture.cpp:58 @ ImageTexture::create_from_image()\n  <Stack Trace> test.tscn::GDScript_37kl0:36 @ render()\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nI'm not quite sure what exactly causes it, but I've been able to make a stripped down project where changing any line in the shader prevents the crash from happening.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[temp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26136539/temp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117667/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"lau